{"id":"o-captainalexinshore-com","title":"Captain Alex Inshore Charters","cat":"water","art":"fishing","area":"Charleston, SC","metroId":"charleston","src":"captainalexinshore.com","rating":5,"reviews":9,"specs":[],"options":[{"name":"Fishing Reports","detail":"2 hours","price":300},{"name":"Fishing Reports","detail":"3 hours","price":450},{"name":"Fishing Reports","detail":"4 hours","price":600},{"name":"Fishing Reports","detail":"5 hours","price":750},{"name":"Fishing Reports","detail":"6 hours","price":900},{"name":"Fishing Reports","detail":"8 hours","price":1600},{"name":"Fishing Reports","detail":"10 hours","price":2000}],"services":[{"name":"Fishing Reports","desc":"The rain seemed to finally quit, water has cleared and the fish are biting. We are finding redfish in large schools on the flats, and around docks in deep creeks. Some trout are starting to show up with the warmer water temperatures. Most redfish are being caught on live shrimp under popping corks and cut fresh blue crab on the bottom. As the water warms up the trout should be found in more numbers. Spring time fishing is in full swing right now! The nearshore reefs are loaded right now with sheepshead. Guys are coming back to the dock with solid stringers of sheepshead. Most of the fish are being caught on live fiddler crabs. We are also catching some nice black drum and weakfish right now","photo":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/8f59cf_b3900f673b4e4c7f9016310a1155b2bd~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_600,h_600,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/8f59cf_b3900f673b4e4c7f9016310a1155b2bd~mv2.jpg","variants":[{"label":"2 hours","price":300,"optionIdx":0},{"label":"3 hours","price":450,"optionIdx":1},{"label":"4 hours","price":600,"optionIdx":2},{"label":"5 hours","price":750,"optionIdx":3},{"label":"6 hours","price":900,"optionIdx":4},{"label":"8 hours","price":1600,"optionIdx":5},{"label":"10 hours","price":2000,"optionIdx":6}]}],"includes":[],"addons":[],"gap":"Prices, hours and eligibility ar